465
00:35:57,500 --> 00:36:01,140
Amazônia brasileira, 100% comandada pelo PCC,

466
00:36:01,300 --> 00:36:04,180
Comando Vermelho, venezuelanos, colombianos

467
00:36:04,180 --> 00:36:05,820
